From ee94113d59ed7f74a6adffeea871d274df6f105e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QR Generator <you@example.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 07:17:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Fix QR generator: embed self-contained QR library

- Bundles the qrcode npm library's source directly into index.html
- Removes dependency on a broken/missing jsdelivr CDN build for
  recent qrcode package versions (1.5.3/1.5.4 never published
  a build/ folder, so the CDN script 404'd)
- Verified end-to-end: generates and correctly decodes QR codes
  (e.g. EM12837318) matching expected output
---
 index.html | 196 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 196 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 index.html

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7cffb18
--- /dev/null
+++ b/index.html
@@ -0,0 +1,196 @@
